# Why this Module ships no seed/ directory.
# A marker with no justification is a silent skip in file form; lint-config
# refuses an empty one.

Grafana has conf/provisioning/ and dashboards/, and neither is seed data.
conf/provisioning/ is configuration read at startup — datasources and the
dashboard provider — and is bind-mounted read-only, so Grafana never writes to
it and re-reads it on every restart. dashboards/ is a live drop-zone Grafana
re-scans every 30 seconds; it is tracked only by its .gitkeep. Seed data is
written once into a volume and then owned by the service; neither of these is.
